sequenceDiagram
    participant "GitHub Actions (CI/CD)" as GitHubActionsCICD
    participant "AWS Cloud Development Kit (CDK)" as AWSCloudDevelopmentKitCDK
    participant "Backend Host (Production Env)" as BackendHostProductionEnv
    participant "Monitoring Platform" as MonitoringPlatform
    participant "Mobile App Build Artifacts" as MobileAppBuildArtifacts
    participant "Apple App Store / Google Play Store" as AppleAppStoreGooglePlayStore

    activate GitHubActionsCICD
    GitHubActionsCICD->>GitHubActionsCICD: 1. [on: push, branches: [main]] Trigger 'Production Deploy' Workflow
    GitHubActionsCICD->>GitHubActionsCICD: 2. Build backend container image and mobile app artifacts (.ipa, .aab)
    GitHubActionsCICD-->>GitHubActionsCICD: Build artifacts stored
    activate AWSCloudDevelopmentKitCDK
    GitHubActionsCICD->>AWSCloudDevelopmentKitCDK: 3. Execute 'cdk deploy' for production environment
    AWSCloudDevelopmentKitCDK-->>GitHubActionsCICD: CloudFormation Stack Update Status (SUCCESS/FAIL)
    activate BackendHostProductionEnv
    AWSCloudDevelopmentKitCDK->>BackendHostProductionEnv: 4. Provision/Update AWS infrastructure and deploy new backend container version
    GitHubActionsCICD->>BackendHostProductionEnv: 5. Execute E2E Test Suite against deployed production backend
    BackendHostProductionEnv-->>GitHubActionsCICD: Test Execution Report (Pass/Fail)
    activate AppleAppStoreGooglePlayStore
    GitHubActionsCICD->>AppleAppStoreGooglePlayStore: 6. If E2E tests pass, upload and submit mobile builds (from Step 2) for review
    AppleAppStoreGooglePlayStore-->>GitHubActionsCICD: Submission Acknowledged
    AppleAppStoreGooglePlayStore->>GitHubActionsCICD: 7. Notify build review status (Approved/Rejected) via webhook
    GitHubActionsCICD->>AppleAppStoreGooglePlayStore: 8. On 'Approved' status, trigger phased release to production
    AppleAppStoreGooglePlayStore-->>GitHubActionsCICD: Release Initiated
    activate MonitoringPlatform
    BackendHostProductionEnv->>MonitoringPlatform: 9. Begin intensive monitoring: Continuously emit metrics, logs, and traces
    MonitoringPlatform->>GitHubActionsCICD: 10. Evaluate go-live success criteria against defined CloudWatch Alarms
    GitHubActionsCICD-->>MonitoringPlatform: Health Status (OK/ALARM)
    GitHubActionsCICD->>GitHubActionsCICD: 11. After 72h, finalize deployment report (Success/Rolled Back) and notify team


    deactivate MonitoringPlatform
    deactivate AppleAppStoreGooglePlayStore
    deactivate BackendHostProductionEnv
    deactivate AWSCloudDevelopmentKitCDK
    deactivate GitHubActionsCICD
